WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Introducing Global Store, a simplified way to expand to new destinations for FBA sellers.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:16.800
Our dashboard is personalized to highlight action items and insights.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:26.600
Amazon fulfills orders with existing FBA inventory, and customers are responsible for import duties

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.000
and taxes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Our reliable fulfillment network takes care of delivery, customer support, and returns.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
These features are available in your Seller Central account at no additional cost.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Just visit your Global Store dashboard to start reaching customers around the world.
